5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to know what the car looks like when I actually pick it up.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,And I need to know how many hours I waste just figuring out who’s driving.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"I am curious about what an even split truly requires, beyond the simple idea of sharing equally.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to understand what actually breaks the trust between us before we make any more promises.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I need the real numbers. Who actually drives, and what does a year really cost?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, your hours are important, but I also need to see the car’s condition at handover.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, fair point. But without knowing the time cost, I can’t even judge if the condition is worth the hassle.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, your figures are vital, but I wonder if the paperwork reveals who truly bears the burden.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, the numbers are good, but I’m worried about the tension. Let’s look at what other households said about why they failed.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I hear you, but I can’t fix the tension without knowing the actual costs. I’m choosing the fuel receipts and the tax papers.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
