35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,- **Misaki**: The car is often empty and messy when I arrive.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,"- **May**: My diary shows Saturdays are triple the hours of Tuesdays, and tracking it took an hour weekly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: The paperwork shows over 280,000 yen in fixed costs, and the mechanic warns short runs damage the car.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,- **Takumi**: Both other groups said asking for favors every time is what actually breaks the trust.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"- **Kenji**: The fuel receipts are shocking. Two of us bought over half the litres, and one barely shows up.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @May, your diary proves the chaos. I need a system that guarantees the car is ready, not just booked.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I agree. But my data shows the real cost is the time spent untangling it, not just the mess.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, your fuel data is crucial. It proves the ""equal share"" is a myth. We must account for who actually drives.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, the fixed costs are high, but the mechanic’s warning about short runs explains why the car feels tired.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, exactly. The fixed costs are just the start. The fuel receipts show the driving is wildly unequal, so a simple split is unfair.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @May, the weekly trips keep collapsing. I need a system that guarantees the car is ready, not just booked.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I hear you, but my data shows the real cost is the time spent untangling it, not just the mess.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the mechanic’s warning confirms it. Short, frequent runs destroy the car. We must factor this wear into any fair split.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, the fuel receipts show the imbalance, but my research shows the real poison is the constant asking. We need to stop the favour cycle.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I agree the favour cycle is toxic, but we can’t fix it without knowing the true cost. The numbers show who’s really driving.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @May, I need the car ready, not just booked. A system that guarantees the state, not just the time.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I get it, but my data shows the real cost is the time spent untangling it, not just the mess.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the wear is real, but the favour cycle is the poison. We must stop asking before we split the bill.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, I agree. The favour cycle is the poison. We need a system that removes the need to ask, not just split the bill.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, agreed. But we need the numbers to prove the split is fair. Let’s see the options.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
